---
description: Offline web-interface constraints
globs: ["src/neuroai_workbench/static/**", "src/neuroai_workbench/server.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Use no remote JavaScript, CSS, fonts, analytics, telemetry, or model calls.
- Maintain Content Security Policy and defensive HTTP headers.
- Preserve keyboard usability, semantic HTML, readable contrast, and explicit validation boundaries.
- The UI may display assessor-entered findings; it must not claim to independently prove them.
